{"unit_id":"zerorigin-studio__dsh-desktop-shell#card-zh","repo":"zerorigin-studio/dsh-desktop-shell","commit":"3bee0f09d61029d6571b8e5afb756c538b7ab9bd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-shell 是面向 Windows 的 DSH 桌面壳插件。它在 DSH 启动后检测本地 web 服务端口，将连接地址和运行信息写入本地协议文件，再启动随插件包提供的桌面客户端，让 Harness 界面在独立桌面窗口中打开。插件还提供登录 Windows 后自动启动客户端的设置，并在停用时清理快捷方式及由插件写入的协议文件。适合希望把正在运行的 DSH web 界面作为 Windows 桌面应用使用的人。需要 Windows 桌面客户端和本机运行中的 DSH web 服务，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:219-269","lib/index.js:280-330"]}
{"unit_id":"zerorigin-studio__dsh-desktop-shell#card-en","repo":"zerorigin-studio/dsh-desktop-shell","commit":"3bee0f09d61029d6571b8e5afb756c538b7ab9bd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-desktop-shell opens a Windows desktop window for a running DSH web server. It detects the local port, writes connection details for the bundled client, and syncs an autostart setting with Windows login. For people who prefer Harness as a desktop app; requires Windows and a local DSH server.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:219-269","lib/index.js:280-330"]}
